"Linux or macOS. Every dependency resolves from PyPI, so a plain `uv sync`"
" needs nothing but network access to the index."
msgstr ""
"Linux 或 macOS。所有依赖都来自 PyPI，所以一次普通的 `uv sync` 除了能访问索引之外别无要求。"

